# ✅ PHASE 7 — Group Policy & Time Synchronization

### Objective

Begin centralized workstation management.

### GPO

```text
RHINWOOD - Workstation Security
```

### Completed

Configured:

```text
Interactive logon:
Machine inactivity limit
= 900 seconds
= 15 minutes
```

Verified with:

```cmd
gpupdate /force
gpresult /scope computer /r
```

Registry verification:

```cmd
reg query "HKLM\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Policies\System" /v InactivityTimeoutSecs
```

### Troubleshooting completed

Discovered domain time synchronization failure.

Used:

```cmd
w32tm /query /status
w32tm /query /source
w32tm /stripchart /computer:DC01 /samples:5 /dataonly
```

Initial difference:

```text
≈ +32388 seconds
≈ 9 hours
```

After correcting time configuration:

```text
≈ +34 seconds
```

Then:

```text
Computer Policy update has completed successfully.
User Policy update has completed successfully.
```

